"compatibility.description" = "iOS 17/18 uses local notifications for primary alarms. These do not guarantee sound through silent mode or Focus. iOS 26 and later uses AlarmKit for primary alarms; authorized alarms can break through silent mode and Focus, but iOS still provides a stop control. All versions use limited local notifications for follow-ups. They do not inherit AlarmKit's stronger delivery. Camera challenges run only while Okiru is open. Screen Time requires permission and can be revoked. Never assume a five-second background loop or an unbreakable device lock. Actual follow-up count and end time are shown in Alarm.";
