"privacy.body" = "Okiru works without an account, advertising or tracking. Alarm settings, task counts and history stay on this device. The front camera is processed locally to detect body joints; Okiru does not save or upload video. Screen Time app selections are handled using Apple's privacy-preserving tokens. If you choose to send feedback, its text, optional email and app/system/language details are sent to the developer's dedicated Google Apps Script and Google Sheet. No camera frames or alarm history are included. You can clear completed history or reset Okiru in Settings. Removing permissions prevents the related feature from operating. This development build still requires production support and privacy URLs before release.";
